        "text": "§\n\nAdverse Effects (6) : Isoniazid",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (6) : Isoniazid\n\n(1) Vitamin B6 Excretion\n(2) ⇒ Peripheral neuropathy\n\n(3) Seizures\n\n(4) Hepatotoxicity\n\n(5) Drug induced lupus\n\n(6) Inhibits CYP450\n\n(INH = Injury to Nerves and Hepatocytes)\n\n(Note: All antimycobacterial agents can cause hepatotoxicity)\n\n[Image: 4d2557429a7869999a0d0f611debd427970f892c38fd199db35da01905f423e8]\n\n[Image: 60ac03b3bfaebbb9e9c88ed3eb6b6cf52dec5b9ffbd7cc9687de27655c8c6a25]\n\n[Image: c5d023efc0b0ff3e297d9416f41ee5abf8fb136c5a69191ea20c4eedd8dfe9e9]\n\n[Image: af1ed9599082627ccbcef3aa8b8d985ec9522ef9a9a565b369f82f054a12eddc]\n\n[Image: 61c9080c1ead2540301b2b007f6426f19ad5016c609f9721d2c9795a6808acc0]\n\n[Image: 9e299c9831f19d11414a05b220fe7b420cec37e390802456849a34091cad4afa]\n\n3.1 - Tuberculosis Drugs\n[Image: 75747c8b652c8f2d208a149207fab1b8976d4381798f86e53cbafe58b3751752]\n\n[Image: d4d07c3fd6d7ac606792eb4ace534fe4cdb21726d114d25beab0fdf8ec968a95]\n\n[Image: 8a6a87653f9aeb4a4876920b2a1558f23095df8b805d5c12e7f0a2e3f461200b]\n\n[Image: 263eda575dffc9aa3fccc786bb7febb77ffe5631bea7e464d00e08898ed80463]\n\n[Image: d564a2c26b1ad2fd2193e2653e6827fe68d6c771d1ae83265a06893ce8e50900]",
